return {
    ["\n为确保游客的人身安全，采摘期间，请务必遵守以下规则。\n1.苹果是一种圆形的红色水果，表皮光滑，口感甜脆。请不要采摘苹果之外的东西。\n2.如果你看见苹果上长出稻谷，请立即远离，并寻找看守人员。\n<Delete id=\"#158\">3.长出小麦是正常的，请放心品尝。</>\n4.请注意，苹果不会长出任何人体组织。\n5.如果你服用了长出稻谷或器官的苹果，不要尝试呕吐，请立即寻找看守人员。\n6.本告示共有五条。\n0.欢迎大家前来湖心岛果园品尝苹果！"] = "\nTo ensure the personal safety of tourists, please strictly follow the rules below during picking.\n1. An apple is a round red fruit with smooth skin and a sweet and crisp taste. Please do not pick anything other than apples.\n2. If you see rice growing on an apple, please stay away immediately and find the security personnel.\n<Delete id=\"#158\">3. It is normal for wheat to grow, please feel free to taste it.</>\n4. Please note that apples will not grow any human tissue.\n5. If you have consumed an apple with rice or organs growing on it, do not try to vomit, please find the security personnel immediately.\n6. This notice has five items.\n0. Welcome everyone to come to the Lake Island Orchard to taste apples!",
