    ["<Assistant_Title1>【今夜好眠】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>扮演故事</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>深夜的街道上，年轻人马丁因目睹工厂锅炉爆炸事故而饱受失眠折磨。作为心理医生，你需要对他进行心理安抚。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>晋升至序列7，前往{Location:[廷根(1010,1309)]|1049;31418;-2608;2;5200002;0}可触发任务\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、世界冒险秘宝进度，冒险勋章，发票单据"] = "<Assistant_Title1>[A Good Night's Sleep]</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Roleplay Story</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>On the streets late at night, a young man named Martin is suffering from insomnia after witnessing a factory boiler explosion. As a psychologist, you need to provide him with psychological pacification.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Advance to Sequence 7 and head to {Location:[Tingen(1010,1309)]|1049;31418;-2608;2;5200002;0} to trigger the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognitive Experience, World Adventure Treasure Progress, Adventure Medal, Invoice Receipt",
