    ["致不幸落败的%s：\n      真是有趣，看着你被乌黯魔狼屡屡折磨，我不禁想起了一些快乐的事——当年，尊敬的“愚者”先生和你一样，祂是先▇ ▇ ▇又▇ ▇ ▇，甚至▇ ▇ ▇ ▇ ▇，给我留下了许多美好的回忆。\n      作为感谢，我也向祂提供过不菲的回报。既然你是祂意志的继承人，我愿意提供一些可靠的帮助：遵循<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1302126\">乌黯魔狼的记载</>交战，或者选择我附在信末的这套恰到好处的套路，就能轻松获得胜利。\n      期待你此后的成长，这将成为我新的乐趣。<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1250207\">点此查看套路</>"] = "To the unfortunately defeated %s:\n      How interesting, watching you be repeatedly tormented by the Dark Demonic Wolf, I cannot help but recall some happy times—back then, the respected Mr. \"Fool\" was just like you; He first ▇ ▇ ▇ and then ▇ ▇ ▇, and even ▇ ▇ ▇ ▇ ▇, leaving me with many wonderful memories. \n      As a token of gratitude, I also provided Him with a handsome reward. Since you are the heir to His will, I am willing to provide some reliable help: follow the <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1302126\">Records of the Dark Demonic Wolf</> to engage in battle, or choose this perfectly timed strategy I have attached to the end of the letter, and you will easily achieve victory. \n      I look forward to your growth hereafter; this will become my new amusement. <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1250207\">Click here to view the strategy</>",
